//////**********************method ovrloading  or function overloading ***********************///////////////

we can't create a duplicate function in java.
having a multiple method with the same name but different paramater in the same class.

public class hello{

    void display(){                      //function with same name but with different parameter
        System.out.println("one");
    }
    void display(int a){                 //this is called method or function overloading
        System.out.println("two");
    }
    public static void main(String args[]){
        hello obj = new hello();
        obj.display(2);

}
}
